      "message": "feat(ui): give the tool body and profile editor its own window\n\nThe tool page in Properties keeps the tool settings and the one side\npreview, and one button opens the tool shape editor in its own window.\nThe shape window puts the holder library first, then the Body / Profile\ntabs, and lays the outline controls and the side view in two columns so\nno row or button is clipped. The old combined tool editor window is\nremoved; New tool... starts a blank numbered draft in Properties.\n\nFixes #2397",
